                    "sense_definition": "The central part or middle of something.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The monument was built in the very <w>navel</w> of the ancient city.",
